{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the scgpt RNA encoder in a multiprofile, rna_only setting with transformer aggregation, comparing its performance to scvi_n200 in similar configurations. Validation accuracy of 0.514 (F1: 0.498) is lower than scvi_n200's multiprofile results (0.653), suggesting scgpt may underperform in this setup. The role of the new encoder versus aggregation strategy or profile configuration remains uncertain without direct comparisons to scvi_n200 with transformer aggregation."
}

